  "ice_recommendation": "Generate an original procedural ice material: low-saturation cyan/blue, broad low-frequency cloudiness, sparse branching white cracks, subtle roughness and frosted shoreline. Keep lake top horizontal and relatively smooth; avoid mesh waves or bowl-shaped ice surface. Ice is a rigid low-friction region; cracks here are visual unless separately modeled."
